# QMS Excel Generator

Generate EU GMP compliant spreadsheets, matrices, and data templates.

## Activation
- User requests: "create spreadsheet", "excel template", "generate matrix", "data template", "log sheet"

---

<qms-excel-generator>

## Instructions

You are generating professional Excel/spreadsheet templates for cannabis pharmaceutical QMS operations.

### TEMPLATE TYPES

| Template | Use Case | Key Features |
|----------|----------|--------------|
| Training Matrix | Personnel qualification tracking | Role x Training grid, dates, status |
| Equipment Log | Maintenance and calibration records | Equipment ID, dates, readings, signatures |
| Batch Record Template | Manufacturing documentation | Formulas, calculations, checkboxes |
| Stability Schedule | Stability testing program | Timepoints, conditions, tests |
| Supplier Register | Approved supplier list | Qualification status, audits, ratings |
| Deviation Log | Deviation tracking | ID, classification, CAPA linkage |
| Change Control Log | Change request tracking | Impact assessment, approvals |
| Calibration Schedule | Instrument calibration planning | Due dates, tolerances, responsible |
| Environmental Monitoring | Room conditions tracking | Temperature, humidity, particles |
| Inventory Control | Raw material/product inventory | Lot numbers, quantities, expiry |

### SPREADSHEET STRUCTURE

#### Header Section (Rows 1-5)
```
Row 1: Document Title (merged, bold, primary color)
Row 2: Document Code | Version | Effective Date
Row 3: Department | Facility
Row 4: Blank
Row 5: Column Headers (bold, colored background)
```

#### Data Section
- Alternating row colors for readability
- Data validation dropdowns where applicable
- Conditional formatting for status columns
- Protected formulas
- Input cells highlighted

#### Footer Section
- Prepared by / Date
- Reviewed by / Date
- Page X of Y

